n- The XR bar shows the stream quality.\r\n- New: create your own Favorites lists, synced across your devices.\r\n- Favorite a channel with one tap from Live TV and Sports.\r\n- Movie posters now show how far you've watched, synced across your devices.\r\n- Preview a live channel at the top of Live TV and Search before opening the full player.\r\n- Redesigned Live TV channel cards: clean logos with Preview, favorite and Start Over buttons below.\r\n- \"On Now\" shows what is playing on each channel in Live TV, the player and Continue Watching.\r\n- Sports game cards now show the date and time.\r\n- Remove entries from Recent in the category picker.\r\n- Choose a Version no longer marks versions as Not available by mistake.\r\n- Channel logos look cleaner, with white logos on a dark background.\r\n- Fixes and stability improvements.", "created_date": 1791601035, "id": "28427288650269708", "version": "3.3.6", "version_code": 4169, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26465441283121131", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28427288650269708"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "994646723277799"}]}, "change_log": "-Videos now keep playing when you use another app or panel next to o3IPTV, so you can watch while you play or browse.", "created_date": 1791056295, "id": "28342832718715302", "version": "3.3.5", "version_code": 4156, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26465441283121131", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28427288650269708"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "994646723277799"}]}, "change_log": "- Watch in XR 3D now plays 180 and 360 degree VR videos, in 3D or mono, detected from the title or set with Projection in the player.\r\n- VR 180 and VR 360 titles show a VR chip on their details page and open in XR on every Quest, picking the VR version when a movie has several.\r\n- In 180 and 360 videos, the controls appear where you look and the display follows the film's frame rate.\r\n- Your 180 or 360 pick is remembered for each title.\r\n- Switch movie versions without leaving XR 3D, and Continue Watching keeps one row for the movie.\r\n- The headset battery shows on the XR control bar, with low battery notices at 15% and 5%.\r\n- Controller ray: menus and buttons light up when you point at them.\r\n- Lists in every sheet now scroll with the controller ray, and the player and language pickers show a scrollbar.\r\n- Single-connection playlists no longer get cut off by background checks.\r\n- When all connections are in use, the message now suggests another playlist if you have one.\r\n- Sports match pages open with their channels in place.", "created_date": 1790924318, "id": "28323084267356814", "version": "3.3.5", "version_code": 4155, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26465441283121131", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28427288650269708"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "994646723277799"}]}, "change_log": "- Fixed a crash when closing the app while a video was playing.\r\n- Browse by Genre on Home: new, popular and top rated titles from your playlist, with grid, list and sorting.\r\n- New Favorites row on Home: your channels, movies, series and teams.\r\n- Exclude new categories automatically, per playlist, synced across your devices.\r\n- Fixed endless loading on some providers that then said all connections were in use.\r\n- New-category notices now show only on the main profile.", "created_date": 1790447418, "id": "28257836330548275", "version": "3.3.4", "version_code": 4136, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26465441283121131", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28427288650269708"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "994646723277799"}]}, "change_log": "- XR 3D: a press on a side panel slider grabs the knob where it is, so one sweep sets the value you meant, and the picture and its panels glide together while it resizes.\r\n- XR 3D: a film's own letterbox settles in about half a second again, and a dark shot can no longer squeeze the picture toward a square.\r\n- XR 3D: the Passthrough tile carries a clean icon that matches Void beside it.\r\n- The XR 3D settings block is gone from Settings. The in-headset panels are the place for those controls, and your saved values are unchanged.\r\n- Signing out returns to the Welcome screen instead of a stale code step.\r\n- A running download no longer follows the headset to the next account, and an account switch or a cold start can no longer cost you your sign-in.\r\n- Browse in a list or a grid, and sort by name, release year or recently added.\r\n- Sports: choose your favorite leagues, then open My leagues for today's games and what is coming up.\r\n- On a game, o3IPTV finds the channels carrying it from your own guide and from channel names.\r\n- Live and upcoming games on Home stay current instead of lingering after they end.\r\n- Devices in your account now show their real names, Device Management says how many of your slots are in use, and signing in at the limit lets you pick a device to sign out and then finishes by itself.\r\n- A headset that was signed out now says why it happened and how to get back in.\r\n- Approving a new device explains a failed code in plain words.\r\n- You can sign in to OpenSubtitles again when a subtitle session expires, with a clear message when it fails.\r\n- VPN: Renew connection keeps the server you were on, shows its progress and confirms in place.\r\n- Portuguese wording is consistent across the app.", "created_date": 1790012192, "id": "28188299177501991", "version": "3.3.3", "version_code": 4134, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}